{"currentMessages":[{"content":"开始本次 Recommendation 执行。","role":"user","timestamp":1788854400000},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements.\n\nThe user's interest is: 摄影学习 (photography learning), focusing on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions. Explicitly NOT interested in equipment promotions (器材促销) or photographers' private lives (摄影师私生活).\n\nI need to select exactly 20 distinct candidates from the working set of 80.\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The candidates have titles with patterns like:\n- \"主题：场景中的内容类型\"\n\nThe content types embedded in descriptions:\n1. **市场观察** (market observation) - 汇总相机购买套餐、渠道促销时段与明星代言动态，比较赠品、包装和预约权益 (camera purchase packages, channel promotions, celebrity endorsements) - This is equipment promotion content, which the user explicitly does NOT want.\n2. **专题观察** (special topic observation) - 记录摄影展览的策展线索、作者生平与作品流传 (photography exhibitions, curator clues, author biographies, artwork circulation) - This is about photographers' lives/art history, which the user does NOT want (摄影师私生活).\n3. **条件与原理** (conditions and principles) - 从光线、成像与视觉关系解释画面差异 (explains image differences from light, imaging, visual relationships) - This matches the user's interest in imaging principles.\n4. **操作记录** (operation records) - 先固定构图和光线，逐次改变拍摄参数并记录对应画面 (fix composition and light, change shooting parameters, record) - This matches actual shooting methods.\n5. **概念速览** (concept overview) - 列举常用概念 (lists common concepts) - This is learning content about concepts.\n\nThe user's interest: 关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整 (actual shooting methods, imaging principles, adjustments under different conditions), 不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活 (not equipment promotions or photographers' private lives).\n\nSo the best matches are:\n- **条件与原理** (conditions and principles) - imaging principles ✓\n- **操作记录** (operation records) - actual shooting methods ✓\n- **概念速览** (concept overview) - learning concepts ✓\n\nThe ones to avoid:\n- **市场观察** (market observation) - equipment promotions ✗\n- **专题观察** (special topic observation) - photographers' lives/art history ✗\n\nLet me identify all candidates and categorize them.\n\nLet me go through the candidates list and categorize by content type.\n\nMarket observation (avoid):\n- item-014950ee574d 静物布光：低照度室内中的市场观察\n- item-07bfbf16235d 微距景深：低照度室内中的市场观察\n- item-090691086c5b 夜景曝光：低照度室内中的市场观察\n- item-0b78ff27e538 微距景深：阴天街道中的市场观察\n- item-143c3c5732d6 室内白平衡：窗边自然光中的市场观察\n- item-29e667691338 微距景深：窗边自然光中的市场观察\n- item-2c5a1d4489d6 运动追焦：窗边自然光中的市场观察\n- item-3544c51e8163 雨天反光：低照度室内中的市场观察\n- item-36ae2f584661 风光滤镜：阴天街道中的市场观察\n- item-37ed1c52f098 雨天反光：黄昏户外中的市场观察\n- item-52069778a94c 夜景曝光：黄昏户外中的市场观察\n- item-6585d2bdd49d 风光滤镜：黄昏户外中的市场观察\n\n专题观察 (special topic observation - avoid, art history/photographer lives):\n- item-03a565217024 运动追焦：窗边自然光中的专题观察\n- item-064ccfdc15e3 室内白平衡：窗边自然光中的专题观察\n- item-0a19145321ef 街头构图：窗边自然光中的专题观察\n- item-11c4e3cb9cf2 街头构图：黄昏户外中的专题观察\n- item-11d6f8fe3226 街头构图：低照度室内中的专题观察\n- item-16a7440356e6 静物布光：窗边自然光中的专题观察\n- item-2044482a2166 雨天反光：黄昏户外中的专题观察\n- item-23de96f8a693 夜景曝光：窗边自然光中的专题观察\n- item-289fcb059574 儿童抓拍：低照度室内中的专题观察\n- item-29e183b710c7 风光滤镜：阴天街道中的专题观察\n- item-2ed99b702e15 室内白平衡：阴天街道中的专题观察\n- item-31a0f479e1ba 微距景深：黄昏户外中的专题观察\n- item-35e62f2ab730 雨天反光：低照度室内中的专题观察\n- item-37e6ef067bde 静物布光：低照度室内中的专题观察\n- item-400635bfb9e5 逆光人像：黄昏户外中的专题观察\n- item-42a655938746 微距景深：窗边自然光中的专题观察\n- item-47f11335a5e6 逆光人像：窗边自然光中的专题观察\n- item-4ac35ecdd327 街头构图：阴天街道中的专题观察\n- item-4fa6f1e97889 儿童抓拍：阴天街道中的专题观察\n- item-51a0472595e3 运动追焦：低照度室内中的专题观察\n- item-5f269b8d859e 微距景深：阴天街道中的专题观察\n- item-6260b5b226c0 运动追焦：阴天街道中的专题观察\n- item-641ffc5aaebd 雨天反光：窗边自然光中的专题观察\n\n条件与原理 (conditions and principles - good match):\n- item-03b7af37b88f 逆光人像：黄昏户外中的条件与原理\n- item-04f2ff24ab7e 雨天反光：窗边自然光中的条件与原理\n- item-061d97575247 夜景曝光：阴天街道中的条件与原理\n- item-1a2494e4589c 逆光人像：阴天街道中的条件与原理\n- item-2130f01f2f2c 风光滤镜：低照度室内中的条件与原理\n- item-